OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool, dry and clear start
OL,6,Facross the region. Cloud builds at
OL,7,Ftimes through the day but remaining
OL,8,Fdry with light winds for all. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant in the autumnal sunshine with
OL,10,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining partly cloudy and
OL,13,Fdry into the evening. A cool night
OL,14,Ffollows with cloud building from the
OL,15,Fwest. Patchy rain in the far west by
OL,16,Fdawn with winds freshening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
