OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy but mostly dry to
OL,6,Fstart, patchy light rain developing
OL,7,Fduring the morning and lingering
OL,8,Fthrough the day. Fresh winds.
OL,9,FTemperatures above average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,12,Fduring Tuesday morning clears to a
OL,13,Ffine, if a little breezy afternoon.
OL,14,FCloudy but mostly dry on Wednesday and
OL,15,FThursday but fresh to strong winds
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Temperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
